<title>GERMANY: Spar net profit up 40 pct to 105 mln DM.</title>
<headline>Spar net profit up 40 pct to 105 mln DM.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German retail group Spar Handels AG said on Monday extraordinary gains from the sale of building supply stores caused 1996 net profit to rise 40 percent to 105 million marks.</p>
<p>The company also said it planned to raise dividends for 1996 to 40 pfennig per common share, up from 35 pfennig in 1995, and to 52.5 pfennig per preferred share, up from 47.5 pfennig.</p>
</text>
